<h1>Your Temporary Credentials</h1>
<p>Hi there,</p>
<p>An account has been created for you on the Student Peer Review platform by <%= @lecturer_name %> for the course <%= @course_name %>.</p>
<div style="background-color: #f3f4f6; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong>Your Login Email:</strong> <%= @email %></p>
  <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Your Temporary Password:</strong> <%= @temp_password %></p>
</div>
<p>We strongly recommend you change this password immediately. Click the link below to set your own password:</p>
<p><a href="<%= @reset_url %>"><%= @reset_url %></a></p>
<p>This link will expire in 24 hours.</p>
